{"seq":1,"slug":"e-ledger-hierarchy-and-item-filing","title":"电子账册结构模型：账册头、底账、备案商品与料号层级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-warehouse-ledger-integration/eledger-annotation-list/e-ledger-hierarchy-and-item-filing","wordCount":2742,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"电子账册结构模型-账册头-底账-备案商品与料号层级\">电子账册结构模型：账册头、底账、备案商品与料号层级</h1><p>保税仓的系统工程师第一次拿到海关侧的账册数据时，最容易犯的错误是把它当成一张「库存表」来读。它其实是一份<strong>四层嵌套的备案契约</strong>：一本账册有唯一的表头（账册头），表头下按货物在监管链条中的位置分出若干本底账，每本底账里挂着若干条备案商品，每条备案商品背后又压着一家企业内部成千上万条料号。仓库 WMS 里的一条 SKU 记录，要经过归并与单位换算才落成海关账册上的一个数量；这条映射链上任何一环断裂，账册的进出存就对不平——而对不平是海关核查的第一靶点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-四层结构与它们的职责边界\">核心概念：四层结构与它们的职责边界</h2><p>海关保税监管的技术底座是「金关工程二期」（业内通称<strong>金关二期</strong>）体系下的账册管理系统（<a href=\"http://www.customs.gov.cn/\">海关总署</a>）。在这个体系里，<strong>核注清单</strong>负责申报货物明细并在账册上记账，<strong>核放单</strong>负责放行货物实际进出卡口。两者都落在账册这个容器上，而账册本身是一棵树：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  H[&quot;账册头 E-Head&lt;br/&gt;账册编号 / 经营单位 / 监管方式&lt;br/&gt;主管海关 / 核销周期 / 担保额度&quot;] --&gt; L1[&quot;底账 · 进口&lt;br/&gt;进境入仓&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; L2[&quot;底账 · 库存&lt;br/&gt;在库监管&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; L3[&quot;底账 · 出口&lt;br/&gt;复运出境&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; L4[&quot;底账 · 结转 / 处置&lt;br/&gt;区内流转 · 销毁 · 内销征税&quot;]&#10;  L2 --&gt; I[&quot;备案商品 Item&lt;br/&gt;项号 + HS 编码 + 法定单位 + 申报要素&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; S[&quot;企业料号 SKU&lt;br/&gt;内部物料编码(多对一归并)&quot;]&#10;  I -.核注清单表体按项号记账.-&gt; N[&quot;核注清单&quot;]&#10;  H -.担保额度约束.-&gt; N\">graph TD\n  H[\"账册头 E-Head&lt;br/&gt;账册编号 / 经营单位 / 监管方式&lt;br/&gt;主管海关 / 核销周期 / 担保额度\"] --&gt; L1[\"底账 · 进口&lt;br/&gt;进境入仓\"]\n  H --&gt; L2[\"底账 · 库存&lt;br/&gt;在库监管\"]\n  H --&gt; L3[\"底账 · 出口&lt;br/&gt;复运出境\"]\n  H --&gt; L4[\"底账 · 结转 / 处置&lt;br/&gt;区内流转 · 销毁 · 内销征税\"]\n  L2 --&gt; I[\"备案商品 Item&lt;br/&gt;项号 + HS 编码 + 法定单位 + 申报要素\"]\n  I --&gt; S[\"企业料号 SKU&lt;br/&gt;内部物料编码(多对一归并)\"]\n  I -.核注清单表体按项号记账.-&gt; N[\"核注清单\"]\n  H -.担保额度约束.-&gt; N</pre><p>四层各自的职责边界必须分清，因为它们由不同岗位、按不同节奏维护：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>维护者</th>\n<th>变更频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>账册头</td>\n<td>谁、以什么监管方式、在哪个关区、核销周期多长、担保多少</td>\n<td>关务主管 + 法人主体</td>\n<td>极低（账册级变更须审批）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>底账</td>\n<td>这批货现在处于监管链条的哪一段</td>\n<td>关务运营</td>\n<td>高（随每次进出变动）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>备案商品</td>\n<td>具体是哪些 HS 编码的商品、以什么法定单位计量</td>\n<td>关务 + 商品归类岗</td>\n<td>中（备案变更）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>料号</td>\n<td>企业内部的哪些物料归并到了这条备案商品</td>\n<td>主数据 / 供应链</td>\n<td>高（随商品上新变动）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>账册头的制度依据是海关总署令第 219 号《海关加工贸易货物监管办法》，商品层依据海关总署商品归类与规范申报要素要求，底账则是金关二期账册体系按货物状态分户的产物。</p>\n<p>一个常见的架构错误是把「底账」和「备案商品」合并成一张表。它们是多对一关系：<strong>同一条备案商品会同时出现在进口底账和库存底账里</strong>；压成一张表会让「在途监管数量」无处安放——货已从进口底账核减、尚未进入库存底账的那几天，账册就出现一个凭空消失的缺口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"账册头-监管身份与核销周期\">账册头：监管身份与核销周期</h2><p>账册头上最重要的字段不是名称，而是<strong>监管方式代码</strong>。它决定了这本账册能装什么货、按什么规则核销。保税仓场景下最常打交道的几个是：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>监管方式代码</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1233</td>\n<td>保税仓库货物</td>\n<td>保税仓库（公用型/自用型/专用型）存储货物</td>\n<td>海关总署《海关对保税仓库及所存货物的管理规定》</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1210</td>\n<td>保税跨境贸易电子商务</td>\n<td>跨境电商网购保税进口，货物先入保税仓再按订单出区</td>\n<td>海关总署公告 2018 年第 194 号（<a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/\">gov.cn</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1239</td>\n<td>保税跨境贸易电子商务 A</td>\n<td>1210 的补充监管方式，用于特定口岸与商品</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9610</td>\n<td>跨境贸易电子商务</td>\n<td>直购进出口，不经过保税仓存储</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>代码选错是账册头最贵的错误：一本实际做 1210 网购保税进口的账册若被备成 1233，出区时的订单推送与清单核放就无法与该账册建立关联，货物在卡口放不出来。第二组关键字段是<strong>核销周期</strong>：加工贸易手册（H 手册）的典型模式是「一本合同一核销」，而<strong>电子账册（E 账册）以企业为单元</strong>，允许在核销周期内滚动增减，到期以账册为单位核销——这正是「联网账册」相对手册的架构优势。第三组是<strong>担保额度</strong>：海关对保税仓库与保税物流中心实行保证金或银行保函制度，<strong>担保不足时货物无法核放</strong>，因此担保余额应当是随每次核放实时扣减、随每次核销释放的活字段。第四组<strong>备案进出口总值与币制</strong>对应料件与成品两个方向的价值流，在核销时与逐项商品的数量×单价做平衡校验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"底账-账册内部的分户账\">底账：账册内部的分户账</h2><p>「底账」是账册头下的分户账，划分依据是<strong>货物在监管链条中所处的位置</strong>，而不是商品类别。同一批货从进境到出境依次流经不同底账，每流经一次就留下增减记录：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>底账</th>\n<th>记录对象</th>\n<th>触发事件</th>\n<th>数量口径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>进口底账</td>\n<td>进境入仓的保税货物</td>\n<td>进境核注清单核放</td>\n<td>按备案商品项号 + 法定单位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存底账</td>\n<td>处于在库监管中的货物</td>\n<td>入仓完成、出仓核减</td>\n<td>期初 + 进 − 出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出口底账</td>\n<td>复运出境 / 出区离境的货物</td>\n<td>出境核注清单核放</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结转 / 处置底账</td>\n<td>区内流转、销毁、内销征税的货物</td>\n<td>核放单 + 核注清单</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>按货物状态分户的建模方式，与保税维修账册的结构同构。海关总署公告 2018 年第 203 号要求保税维修企业建立<strong>待维修货物、已维修货物、无法维修货物的电子底账</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2018-12/31/content_5447554.htm\">gov.cn</a>）。保税仓的底账设计应遵循同样的思路：<strong>底账表达的是「这批货现在归谁监管、下一步能去哪」，不是「这批货是什么」。</strong></p>\n<p>底账层的数量守恒是最基础的一致性约束。对任意一条备案商品项号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span>，账册在任一时刻必须满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>期末</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>期初</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>进</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>出</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>结转出</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>结转入</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q^{\\text{期末}}_{i} = Q^{\\text{期初}}_{i} + Q^{\\text{进}}_{i} - Q^{\\text{出}}_{i} - Q^{\\text{结转出}}_{i} + Q^{\\text{结转入}}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">期末</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">期初</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">进</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">出</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">结转出</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">结转入</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>工程上必须补一个**「在途监管数量」过渡项**：货物从转出地底账核减、尚未在转入地底账核增的那几天它真实存在于运输途中，让两地账册之和始终守恒靠的就是这个显式在途项。跨关区结转还要求<strong>成对写入</strong>，转出地核放单的关键字段作为唯一关联键，否则转入端账册会凭空短缺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"备案商品与料号层级-从-sku-到项号的归并\">备案商品与料号层级：从 SKU 到项号的归并</h2><p>这一层是保税仓与海关之间真正做数据对接的地方：企业侧是可能有上万条记录的物料主数据（料号 / SKU），海关侧是通常只有几十到几百条的<strong>备案商品清单</strong>，两者靠<strong>归并</strong>连接。记企业料号集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.075em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，账册备案商品项号集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{I}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"script\">S</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">I</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msup><mi>π</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">S</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi:\\ \\mathcal{S} \\to \\mathcal{I},\\qquad \\pi^{-1}(i) = \\{\\, s \\in \\mathcal{S} \\mid \\pi(s) = i \\,\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.075em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">I</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.075em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 是满射而不必是单射——这正是归并的意义：把用途、成分、规格相近的料件归并成较少的报核商品项。但归并带来两个必须显式处理的后果。</p>\n<p><strong>其一，单位换算被推迟到归并处。</strong> 海关账册一律以<strong>法定计量单位</strong>计量，而企业内部料号多以成交单位或内部单位（「卷」「箱」「片」）记录。同一条备案商品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的账册数量，由其下全部料号的内部数量经换算系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 累加得到：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>法定</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>π</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q^{\\text{法定}}_{i} = \\sum_{s \\in \\pi^{-1}(i)} q_s \\cdot r_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">法定</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7463em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一个极常见的核销不平根因，就是某个料号的换算系数在两个系统里取了不同的舍入精度，误差在成千上万条料号上被放大，因此换算系数必须<strong>与料号一起受版本管理</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，归并口径必须自洽。</strong> 备案商品层要同时维护 HS 编码（通常到十位）、法定计量单位与<strong>规范申报要素</strong>——规范申报要素由海关总署按章制定并持续更新（例如塑料制品要申报成分含量、单体单元种类及比例、外观），只按内部物料名录入的料号在核放或查验时会因「申报要素不全」被退单。若料件归并了、而库存批次上的「规格型号」仍按原始料号维护，就会出现「有耗料、无对应项号」的悬空引用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"料号层级的系统实现与校验\">料号层级的系统实现与校验</h2><p>上述模型落成表结构，核心是<strong>两层商品表 + 一张归并关系表</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE ledger_head (            -- 账册头&#10;  book_no       text PRIMARY KEY,     -- E 开头账册编号&#10;  trade_mode    text NOT NULL,        -- 监管方式：1233 / 1210 / 1239&#10;  operator_code text NOT NULL,        -- 经营单位十位海关注册编码&#10;  customs_code  text NOT NULL,        -- 主管海关关区代码&#10;  cycle_start   date NOT NULL,&#10;  cycle_end     date NOT NULL,&#10;  guarantee_amt numeric(18,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE ledger_item (            -- 备案商品（海关口径）&#10;  book_no       text NOT NULL REFERENCES ledger_head(book_no),&#10;  item_no       text NOT NULL,        -- 项号：归并后最细记账粒度&#10;  hs_code       text NOT NULL,        -- 十位商品编码&#10;  legal_unit    text NOT NULL,        -- 法定计量单位&#10;  declare_elems jsonb NOT NULL,       -- 规范申报要素&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (book_no, item_no)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE item_sku_mapping (       -- 归并关系（多对一）&#10;  book_no       text NOT NULL,&#10;  item_no       text NOT NULL,        -- 账册 + 项号&#10;  sku_code      text NOT NULL,        -- 企业料号&#10;  conv_factor   numeric(18,6) NOT NULL, -- SKU → 法定单位换算系数&#10;  valid_from    date NOT NULL,&#10;  valid_to      date,                 -- 关闭而非删除&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (book_no, item_no, sku_code, valid_from)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ledger_head</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 账册头</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  book_no       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- E 开头账册编号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trade_mode    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 监管方式：1233 / 1210 / 1239</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  operator_code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 经营单位十位海关注册编码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  customs_code  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 主管海关关区代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cycle_start   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cycle_end     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  guarantee_amt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ledger_item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 备案商品（海关口径）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  book_no       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ledger_head(book_no),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  item_no       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 项号：归并后最细记账粒度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hs_code       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 十位商品编码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  legal_unit    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 法定计量单位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  declare_elems jsonb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 规范申报要素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (book_no, item_no)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> item_sku_mapping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 归并关系（多对一）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  book_no       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  item_no       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 账册 + 项号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_code      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 企业料号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  conv_factor   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- SKU → 法定单位换算系数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_from    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_to      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                 </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 关闭而非删除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (book_no, item_no, sku_code, valid_from)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这张结构里有几处校验必须做成硬约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>项号唯一且不可复用</strong>：核注清单表体以 <code>item_no</code> 为引用键，项号重复会让记账指向歧义。</li>\n<li><strong>HS 与监管方式相容</strong>：保税仓库货物（1233）与跨境电商（1210/1239）的准入要求不同，校验规则不能共用一套清单。</li>\n<li><strong>换算系数与归并关系都必须带版本、不可就地改写</strong>：已发生核注的关系只能新增版本、关闭旧行的 <code>valid_to</code>；运营常提的「料号归并错了改一下」，正确应对正是关旧行、开新行。账册的可审计性依赖于<strong>每一条历史核注都能用当时的映射关系复算</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>电子账册是<strong>四层嵌套的备案契约</strong>：账册头（监管身份）→ 底账（按监管位置分户）→ 备案商品（HS 与法定单位口径）→ 料号（企业内部物料，多对一归并）。</li>\n<li><strong>账册头决定可行性</strong>：监管方式代码（1233 / 1210 / 1239）选错，货物在卡口放不出来；核销周期与担保额度是必须活维护的字段。</li>\n<li><strong>底账表达「货现在归谁监管」</strong>，不是「货是什么」；同一条备案商品会同时出现在多本底账里，因此两者不能压成一张表。</li>\n<li><strong>在途监管数量必须是显式的过渡项</strong>，跨关区结转必须成对写入，才能让两地账册之和守恒。</li>\n<li><strong>归并是多对一映射</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">S</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi:\\mathcal{S}\\to\\mathcal{I}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.075em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>，单位换算被推迟到归并处，换算系数与归并关系都必须受版本管理，历史核注才能复算。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文与相邻主题的分工：底账的进出存如何由核注清单与核放单驱动，见同章 <a href=\"./\">本章导览</a>；账册建立后 WMS 与海关账册如何实时对接与差错重放，见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../wms-customs-integration/\">WMS 与海关系统对接</a>；周期性核销的余料与差异处置，见 <a href=\"../bonded-stocktake-writeoff/\">保税仓盘点与核销</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"电子账册结构模型：账册头、底账、备案商品与料号层级","id":"电子账册结构模型-账册头-底账-备案商品与料号层级"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：四层结构与它们的职责边界","id":"核心概念-四层结构与它们的职责边界"},{"level":2,"text":"账册头：监管身份与核销周期","id":"账册头-监管身份与核销周期"},{"level":2,"text":"底账：账册内部的分户账","id":"底账-账册内部的分户账"},{"level":2,"text":"备案商品与料号层级：从 SKU 到项号的归并","id":"备案商品与料号层级-从-sku-到项号的归并"},{"level":2,"text":"料号层级的系统实现与校验","id":"料号层级的系统实现与校验"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"海关联网监管系统的接入条件与信息化验收要求","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-warehouse-ledger-integration/bonded-warehouse-qualification/networked-supervision-system-access-prerequisites"},"next":{"title":"核注清单的构成、申报要素与和报关单的对应关系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-warehouse-ledger-integration/eledger-annotation-list/annotation-list-declaration-elements-mapping"}}